<title>DUBAI: TENNIS-DUBAI OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DUBAI OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the $1 million Dubai Open men's tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) beat 3-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Jim Courier (U.S.) beat 4-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) 6-2 7-5.  </p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat 7-Boris Becker (Germany),</p>
<p>walkover (Becker withdrew injured)</p>
<p>2-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat Christian Ruud (Norway) 6-4 6-7</p>
<p>(3-6) 7-5</p>
<p>Semifinal line-up:</p>
<p>Ivanisevic v Jiri Novak</p>
<p> Muster     v Courier</p>
